{
 "n5u02d1.c1": {
  "pick": 2,
  "second": "",
  "note": "これ is grammatical but rude when introducing a person to a teacher; こちら is the only acceptable choice."
 },
 "n5u02d1.d1": {
  "pick": 1,
  "second": "",
  "note": ""
 },
 "n5u02d1.d2": {
  "pick": 3,
  "second": "",
  "note": "The question asks 何ですか about a building, so the natural answer is あれは学校です. あれ is not an option, and あそこは学校です is acceptable only if read as 'that place'. The key is the only possible pick, but it trains a less natural answer. Consider adding あれ as the key, or changing the question to あそこは何ですか."
 },
